              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "look"
            },
            {
              "text": "I can deliver from up here instead.",
              "speaker": "character",
              "emotion": "thinking",
              "action": "think"
            },
            {
              "text": "But we cannot see whether the base is ready.",
